According to http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Valkyrie, valkyries do start 
out with a spear in SLASH'EM. This would definitely make valkyries a 
little harder, which may not be what the DevTeam want. Personally I like 
the idea.

I would not support swapping the shield for a helmet however. A +3 
helmet is too overpowered compared to a +3 shield. With the shield, once 
two decent weapons are acquired, the Valk has to make a choice between 
AC and twoweaponing; with the helmet, you can have both. By all means 
give Valkyries a helmet, but no more than +1, and perhaps replace the 
small shield with a +0 large shield to keep the same starting AC.

